title: The 2027 election horizon

@election_year_opens_2027
title: The election year opens
subtitle: Decide which part of eight years of political memory should define Lewica's last campaign.
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 30
order: 1
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2027 and month = 1 and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_open = 1; snap_campaign_left_bonus = 0; news_headline = "The 2027 parliamentary campaign begins before the formal writ"

= January 2027 — the long campaign begins

The constitutional term is entering its final year, and every party is already
turning the record since 2023 into a campaign. Lewica must decide what the
electorate should hear first.

- @opening_record_2027
- @opening_organisation_2027
- @opening_independent_2027

@opening_record_2027
title: Make the governing and parliamentary record the campaign
subtitle: Claim delivery where it exists and accept responsibility for bargains, delays and defeats.
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_strategy = "Record and delivery"; snap_campaign_strategy = election_2027_campaign_strategy; snap_campaign_left_bonus += 0.45; issue_ownership += 3; winner_reputation += 2; coalition_blur += 1; news_headline = "Lewica asks to be judged on the record it helped create"

Every enacted settlement and failed deadline becomes part of one account.
That makes the campaign concrete. It also gives opponents a clean way to
attach Lewica to the cabinet's weakest files.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the opening argument to the events desk

@opening_organisation_2027
title: Put local organisers, unions and movements before the leadership
subtitle: Turn the campaign into a test of the organisation built since 2019, even where national office disappointed.
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_strategy = "Organised social base"; snap_campaign_strategy = election_2027_campaign_strategy; snap_campaign_left_bonus += 0.65; local_network += 2; organiser_energy += 2; media_capacity -= 1; news_headline = "Local organisers open the election year in their own voices"

The first tour belongs to tenants, workplace organisers, councillors and
rights campaigns. National television finds fewer clean leader clips, but the
party begins the year with people capable of carrying a message after the
studio moves on.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the opening argument to the events desk

@opening_independent_2027
title: Draw a line against both conservative blocs
subtitle: Restore a distinct Left claim before tactical voting compresses the field.
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_strategy = "Independent Left"; snap_campaign_strategy = election_2027_campaign_strategy; snap_campaign_left_bonus += 0.55; party_unity += 2; ko_relation -= 4; razem_cooperation += 2; news_headline = "Lewica opens 2027 under an independent banner"

The line gives every surviving Left current a reason to share a stage. KO
immediately warns that a separate campaign could waste the votes needed for a
democratic majority.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the opening argument to the events desk

@campaign_closes_2027
title: The parliamentary campaign closes
subtitle: Choose the final argument before the Sejm and Senate ballots are counted.
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 45
order: 1
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2027 and month = 9 and snap_election_cycle = 0 and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: news_headline = "The final campaign month forces Lewica to choose one closing argument"

= September 2027 — one argument survives the noise

By September, the campaign has narrowed to a single argument. The polls,
committee thresholds and Senate arrangements are already visible; one last
month remains to decide what the Left wants hesitant voters to remember.

- @closing_material_2027
- @closing_democratic_2027
- @closing_ground_2027

@closing_material_2027
title: Close on wages, housing and public services
subtitle: Use the material programme as the distinction from every larger camp.
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_strategy = "Material security"; snap_campaign_strategy = election_2027_campaign_strategy; snap_campaign_left_bonus += 0.85; labor_credibility += 3; economic_issue_salience += 4; ko_relation -= 2; news_headline = "Material security becomes Lewica's closing election argument"

Candidates return to workplaces, hospitals and housing estates with a short
programme. The choice clarifies the party's purpose, even where coalition
partners would prefer a referendum on democratic continuity alone.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the closing argument to the events desk

@closing_democratic_2027
title: Close on the majority needed to defend democratic institutions
subtitle: Reassure tactical voters and accept that KO will receive part of the credit.
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_strategy = "Democratic majority"; snap_campaign_strategy = election_2027_campaign_strategy; snap_campaign_left_bonus += 0.45; ko_relation += 5; constitutional_restraint += 2; coalition_blur += 2; news_headline = "Lewica closes as the social pillar of a democratic majority"

The final rallies show a possible governing majority rather than one party.
The coalition answer is easy to understand; the distinct reason to choose a
Left ballot is less so.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the closing argument to the events desk

@closing_ground_2027
title: Give the last week to the ground campaign
subtitle: Trade a polished national close for turnout work in the places the party still reaches.
on-arrival: election_2027_campaign_strategy = "Organised turnout"; snap_campaign_strategy = election_2027_campaign_strategy; snap_campaign_left_bonus += 0.70; organiser_energy -= 3; turnout_readiness += 4; local_network += 1; news_headline = "The last campaign week belongs to doors, workplaces and local lists"

The closing broadcast is smaller than the rivals' productions. The voter
contact is not. Whether the organisation is large enough will be answered by
the count rather than by another campaign promise.

- @poland_event_queue: Return the closing argument to the events desk

