= Autumn 2027 — polling day

The campaign reaches its final test. The party system now supplies the vote;
every active committee faces its threshold, 460 Sejm seats are apportioned,
and one winner is counted in each of 100 Senate districts.

After certification, the end-game epilogue will measure the coalition's record
and the country it leaves behind.

- @count_parliamentary_election_2027

@count_parliamentary_election_2027
title: Count the 2027 ballots
subtitle: Resolve the live vote and proceed from the certified result to the end-game epilogue.
