priority: 55
order: 1
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and year = 2027 and month = 10 and snap_election_cycle > 0 and snap_campaign_active = 0 and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: ending_exit_type = "Natural conclusion"; news_headline = "An earlier dissolution leaves no scheduled parliamentary election in autumn 2027"

= Autumn 2027 — the counterfactual term continues

An earlier election reset the Sejm and Senate term. Another vote now would
ignore the constitutional calendar created by that break in the sequence, so
this horizon closes on the record left by the replacement parliament instead.

- @earlier_election_epilogue_2027

@earlier_election_epilogue_2027
title: Read the end-game epilogue
subtitle: End the 2027 horizon with the last certified election and the institutions that followed it.
